b1pWQXhCaFhXcXU3aWg2ZkdjR3dOSVdmT0lUZ0YzQVpjc0JfbjhlbFRLdWtTMEJLV1l2Ylo2NTAxMFBicWkwaTczcHBsa056eHdQcTBzMEF4ZWIzZUVjWWxWcEhJc3FscHBjUGhzNTZaZjQxTjRhdmpEcWNBWlhIWU1ZekxtSEV2UVJjaVZ3Mk8yQWlDaC1mTmk?oc=5"},{"d":"2026-10-17T07:00:00+00:00","o":"Markerzone.com","t":"Jamie Drysdale goes against Rick Tocchet's message, and it may not bode well for the Flyers coach","u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE5hR3JmTk0xSnlFQ0VEdmVvcUVJcWc2VGhDdWttUl9QYVQySmNxazk4d2RuYzdCN2ljcFlUNUhUdm5ZUUdRSVpLYWdyQ1ZRVkNrUjN2YU5zRHZoY2pObFJFMw?oc=5"}],"posts":[{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-22T00:32:29+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Well, that was quick. Point shot with traffic in front, Vladar gives up a rebound, and Oliver Kapanen is right there to put it in. I guess Drysdale could have done better work in front on Kapanen there, but also just really strong stuff from Kapanen. 1-1.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2ueigaju22t"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-20T04:12:31+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"More Drysdale, who really wanted to hammer home that it was an ugly win: \n\n\"It was ugly. We didn’t play very well, but we found a way. No quit. A few guys – TK, a heck of a game, took charge, especially in that third period. Very vocal. It was awesome to see.\"","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2pptz6khc2t"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-20T04:10:49+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Jamie Drysdale didn't mince words after the game, even when the first question was asking how they pulled off the comeback.\n\n\"Yeah, it was really ugly. But in saying that, came out on top.\"","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2ppqyb5dk2t"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-20T02:39:21+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"And Jamie Drysdale ties it! His offensive hot streak continues. It was 4-on-4, but the Flyers pulled Woll to have the semi-power play.\n\nSomehow, it's all tied up again. 5-5.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2pkngq4mk2t"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-20T01:26:44+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"And now they take a penalty. Drysdale with the trip.\n\nWhat an awful period for the Flyers.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2pglldqfs2t"}],"team":"PHI","threads":[{"d":"2026-11-10T17:58:07+00:00","sub":"hockey","t":"Trevor Zegras & Jamie Drysdale Relive Playoff Chaos | Luke In The Box","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/hockey/comments/1xstrdy/trevor_zegras_jamie_drysdale_relive_playoff_chaos/"}],"videos":[{"d":"2026-11-20T05:38:28+00:00","id":"pfmVI4P5CqY","k":"presser","t":"11/19 PHI at OTT Postgame: Jamie Drysdale","team":"PHI","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pfmVI4P5CqY"}]}